> Does the absence of replies indicate an absence of such a thesaurus?

It does.  However, the new English-Lojban dictionary will have an entry
for every word (modulo the excessively common ones) in the gismu place
structure sentences.  This file could then be joined (in the RDBMS sense)
with an English thesaurus to produce what you want.

